WEBVTT

00:04:28.651 --> 00:04:30.173
(Smeh)

00:04:30.173 --> 00:04:33.104
Vidite ovo!

00:04:33.104 --> 00:04:35.569
I ovo, i ovo! Vidite!

00:04:35.569 --> 00:04:39.016
Ono što sada gledate

00:04:39.016 --> 00:04:42.103
potpuno je promenilo moj život,

00:04:42.103 --> 00:04:45.080
mislim skroz mi je promenilo život.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.952
Umesto praznih pogleda i neprijatnosti,

00:04:47.952 --> 00:04:51.436
sad pokazuju na mene i smeju se!

00:04:51.436 --> 00:04:55.504
Kažu: "Fenomenalni točkovi, frajeru! Baš su super!

00:04:55.504 --> 00:04:58.104
I ja hoću takve!" Klinci kažu:

00:04:58.104 --> 00:05:00.240
"Mogu li da se provozam?"